infographic sequence-ascending-steps
data
  title B3 → W3C migration — do it in this exact order
  desc Read-both before write-W3C; skip a step and traces split silently
  order asc
  sequences
    - label Audit B3-only services
      desc Find every service still emitting B3-only headers before changing anything.
    - label Deploy composite propagator
      desc Register W3C + B3 multi + B3 single everywhere: read inbound from both, write outbound W3C only.
    - label Verify orphan-span rate
      desc Confirm propagation does not regress; a skipped check hides a silent regression for weeks.
    - label Drop B3 outbound
      desc Disable B3-write at each upstream only after its downstreams are confirmed reading W3C.
    - label Remove B3 extractor
      desc After a quarter at zero B3 inbound, replace the composite with a W3C-only propagator.
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #10b981
